{
 "id": "seg5",
 "title": "谁能换实现",
 "pill": 5,
 "total": 116.4,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg5-00",
   "text": "谁能换实现，谁就拥有全部资金。",
   "spoken": "谁能换实现，谁就拥有全部资金。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg5-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.96,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 4.366
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-01",
   "text": "所以升级权限，要按最高等级来保护。",
   "spoken": "所以升级权限，要按最高等级来保护。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg5-01.wav",
   "start": 4.78,
   "dur": 3.44,
   "speechStart": 4.874,
   "speechEnd": 8.05
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-02",
   "text": "透明代理的权限，在代理的管理员槽位。UUPS 在实现合约的授权函数里。信标在信标的拥有者手里。",
   "spoken": "透明代理的权限，在代理的管理员槽位。UUPS 在实现合约的授权函数里。信标在信标的拥有者手里。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg5-02.wav",
   "start": 8.44,
   "dur": 9.2,
   "speechStart": 8.44,
   "speechEnd": 17.427
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-03",
   "text": "无论在哪，都应该经过多签和时间锁。",
   "spoken": "无论在哪，都应该经过多签和时间锁。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg5-03.wav",
   "start": 17.86,
   "dur": 3.6,
   "speechStart": 17.953,
   "speechEnd": 21.23
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-04",
   "text": "时间锁让升级先排队、再公开，给社区留出复核的时间。",
   "spoken": "时间锁让升级先排队、再公开，给社区留出复核的时间。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg5-04.wav",
   "start": 21.68,
   "dur": 5.92,
   "speechStart": 21.68,
   "speechEnd": 27.352
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-05",
   "text": "但时间锁有另一面。",
   "spoken": "但时间锁有另一面。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg5-05.wav",
   "start": 27.82,
   "dur": 1.84,
   "speechStart": 27.916,
   "speechEnd": 29.424
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-06",
   "text": "2021 年 9 月，Compound 第 62 号提案升级了奖励逻辑，里面有错误，部分用户可以超额领取 COMP。",
   "spoken": "2021 年 9 月，Compound 第 62 号提案升级了奖励逻辑，里面有错误，部分用户可以超额领取 COMP。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg5-06.wav",
   "start": 29.88,
   "dur": 9.04,
   "speechStart": 29.987,
   "speechEnd": 38.767
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-07",
   "text": "按 The Block 报道，最坏情况约 28 万枚，约 8000 万美元。",
   "spoken": "按 The Block 报道，最坏情况约 28 万枚，约 8000 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg5-07.wav",
   "start": 39.14,
   "dur": 5.44,
   "speechStart": 39.237,
   "speechEnd": 44.394
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-08",
   "text": "协议没有能停止分发的紧急开关。任何修复，都要走约 7 天的治理流程。",
   "spoken": "协议没有能停止分发的紧急开关。任何修复，都要走约 7 天的治理流程。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg5-08.wav",
   "start": 44.8,
   "dur": 6.16,
   "speechStart": 44.8,
   "speechEnd": 50.776
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-09",
   "text": "时间锁挡住了恶意升级，也挡住了紧急修复。",
   "spoken": "时间锁挡住了恶意升级，也挡住了紧急修复。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg5-09.wav",
   "start": 51.18,
   "dur": 3.92,
   "speechStart": 51.18,
   "speechEnd": 54.874
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-10",
   "text": "所以暂停权和升级权要分开设计：暂停可以快，升级必须慢。",
   "spoken": "所以暂停权和升级权要分开设计：暂停可以快，升级必须慢。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg5-10.wav",
   "start": 55.32,
   "dur": 7.28,
   "speechStart": 55.416,
   "speechEnd": 62.429
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-11",
   "text": "再往下一层，链本身也可能被升级。",
   "spoken": "再往下一层，链本身也可能被升级。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg5-11.wav",
   "start": 62.82,
   "dur": 3.28,
   "speechStart": 62.916,
   "speechEnd": 65.885
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-12",
   "text": "比如 Mantle。按 L2BEAT 的页面，一个 14 人里 6 人签名的多签，无需延迟就能升级 L1 上的桥和门户合约。",
   "spoken": "比如 Mantle。按 L2BEAT 的页面，一个 14 人里 6 人签名的多签，无需延迟就能升级 L1 上的桥和门户合约。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg5-12.wav",
   "start": 66.32,
   "dur": 10.24,
   "speechStart": 66.42,
   "speechEnd": 76.329
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-13",
   "text": "部署在 L2 上的协议，安全上限就是这条 L2 的升级权限。",
   "spoken": "部署在 L2 上的协议，安全上限就是这条 L2 的升级权限。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg5-13.wav",
   "start": 76.78,
   "dur": 5.12,
   "speechStart": 76.874,
   "speechEnd": 81.675
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-14",
   "text": "合约写得再好，资产也可能在 L1 那一端被转走。",
   "spoken": "合约写得再好，资产也可能在 L1 那一端被转走。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg5-14.wav",
   "start": 82.12,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 82.12,
   "speechEnd": 86.754
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-15",
   "text": "一次安全的升级，按这个顺序走。",
   "spoken": "一次安全的升级，按这个顺序走。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg5-15.wav",
   "start": 87.14,
   "dur": 2.4,
   "speechStart": 87.14,
   "speechEnd": 89.399
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-16",
   "text": "写新实现，只追加变量。用工具比对存储布局。",
   "spoken": "写新实现，只追加变量。用工具比对存储布局。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg5-16.wav",
   "start": 89.76,
   "dur": 4.72,
   "speechStart": 89.76,
   "speechEnd": 94.262
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-17",
   "text": "在主网分叉环境里执行升级，跑全部回归测试。",
   "spoken": "在主网分叉环境里执行升级，跑全部回归测试。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg5-17.wav",
   "start": 94.7,
   "dur": 3.76,
   "speechStart": 94.7,
   "speechEnd": 98.239
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-18",
   "text": "审计新实现，也审计升级交易本身，包括初始化参数。",
   "spoken": "审计新实现，也审计升级交易本身，包括初始化参数。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg5-18.wav",
   "start": 98.68,
   "dur": 4.96,
   "speechStart": 98.68,
   "speechEnd": 103.492
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-19",
   "text": "通过时间锁排队，公开升级内容。执行以后，立刻跑部署后验证。",
   "spoken": "通过时间锁排队，公开升级内容。执行以后，立刻跑部署后验证。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg5-19.wav",
   "start": 103.86,
   "dur": 5.92,
   "speechStart": 103.86,
   "speechEnd": 109.573
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-20",
   "text": "最后，留好回滚方案：新实现有问题时，能不能升级回旧实现？",
   "spoken": "最后，留好回滚方案：新实现有问题时，能不能升级回旧实现？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg5-20.wav",
   "start": 110.0,
   "dur": 5.2,
   "speechStart": 110.0,
   "speechEnd": 115.022
  }
